nltools - Newline caching and quick seeking suite

                                BUILDING nltools

PREREQUISITES

        Without porting, nltools should be buildable via

        >  ISO C99 C compiler

                >   With POSIX or WIN32 SDKs/APIs

COMPILATION

        After entering the src/ directory, compilation should be as simple as
invoking the C99 compiler with whatever flags it needs to use the correct APIs
on the standalone C files `nlcache.c` and `nlseek.c`.

        For `nlseek.c`, the optional DEFINE `Limit2FIO32` may be passed to use
standard ftell and fseek 32-bit behavior.

TESTING

        nltools does not currently provide a test suite.  It may do so later,
but such a test suite is not currently available.  One may want to perform some
sanity checks manually.
